Good Afternoon

Update on Mr Oliver Nycolaysen, VP,Hellmann, Regional office in Dubai, visi=
t to Hanjin, Seoul

According to Hellmann, Dubai, this is regular meeting with various carriers=
 in fareast, to know the carriers plan for 2014 to make their strategies an=
d requirement accordingly.

Their outbound volume will be 90% as against their inbound volume 10%

Their major requirement will be Asia to ME / African ports, the discussions=
 will be mainly on this sector.

Since, outbound rates ex Dubai are very limited, we are negotiating and con=
cluding the deal

Trust above is in order

thanks

best regards
senthil kumar

